                <td namest="1" nameend="2" align="left" id="FOO-00008" class="description-td" colspan="2"> <sup>(7)</sup>(Average pore diameter in coarse-structure layer)/(average pore diameter in dense-structure layer).</td>
              </tr>
              <tr class="description-tr">
                <td namest="1" nameend="2" align="left" id="FOO-00009" class="description-td" colspan="2"> <sup>(8)</sup>(Thickness of coarse-structure layer)/(thickness of dense-structure layer).</td>
              </tr>
